From: MagicX Moss port
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] SDL2: bound Moss Mali NPOT uploads and adapt scanout

Base: RetroArch v1.19.1, 0792144fe3a7b59908b0afdb2c01722e79040360
Only the vendor SDL video driver named mali takes the new upload/window path.
Logical core/menu dimensions are independent of promoted backing allocations.
Clockwise portrait scanout follows the Zero 28 MinUI convention.

